{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 About the Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our time together...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Quintessential Quintuplets OMOIDE VR ~YOTSUBA~ is the second official VR adventure game based on the popular manga series! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Futaro Uesugi and enjoy spending time with the fourth Nakano Quint, Yotsuba, in this VR adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get closer to Yotsuba by experiencing Futaro's daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[All Your Favorite Scenes From the Manga Recreated in VR]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a selection of scenes from the manga recreated in fully-voiced VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to listen out for all your favorite lines as you interact with Yotsuba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Experience Daily Life With Yotsuba]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get closer than ever using VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make memories with Yotsuba and watch as she does her signature smile before your very eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Multiple Dialogue Options &amp; Endings]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from a variety of dialogue options as you play through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep Yotsuba in mind and choose carefully to get the best ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Featured Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yotsuba Nakano (Voiced by Ayane Sakura)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Futaro Uesugi (Played by you!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a9Negi Haruba / Kodansha Ltd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a9NextNinja\u00a0Co.,Ltd.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"NORMAL_END","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni